 ttracts the attention of Don José. She warns him not to fall in love with
  her\, but his obsession knows no bounds. Damiano Michieletto’s searing p
 roduction returns\, casting scorching light on the lust\, violence and de
 structive desire of Bizet’s ever-popular opera. An all-star cast brings t
 his white-hot drama to life\, with Ginger Costa-Jackson in the fiery title
  role\, alongside Russell Thomas as the jealous and despairing Don José. 
 Following his 2023 Royal Opera debut\, Sesto Quatrini returns to conduct 
 Bizet’s electrifying and sensual score.\n\nFilm release at WTW Cinemas Wad
 ebridge\nBook tickets: https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/wadebridge/film/5557/carme
